Reproducer for the vbcc -O=2 register-parameter bug.
See ../../docs/vbcc-O2-bug.md for the full write-up.

    vc +aos68k -c99 -cpu=68020 -O=1 -S bug.c    # correct: a6 is loaded
    vc +aos68k -c99 -cpu=68020 -O=2 -S bug.c    # wrong:   a6 is not

bug.O1.asm and bug.O2.asm are the outputs as produced here, for comparison
without needing the toolchain to hand.

Affected -O values: 2 and 6 -- that is, bit 1 set while bit 0 is clear.
